        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8241.PAT, Contemporary Design One-Sided Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>This Baldwin made Contemporary Deadbolt features a specially designed strike with four security jamb screws for the highest security. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It will fit 1-7/8 inch door cutouts on 1-3/4 inch thick doors. This one sided deadbolt is normally used on patio doors because it has a thumbturn on the inside and no lock cylinder or plate on the outside of the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. There is no plate or exposed trim on the exterior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available:<br> \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-single-cylinder-deadbolt-for-2-1-8-inch-door-preprations-baldwin-8241\"><b>Contemporary Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-double-cylinder-deadbolt-for-2-1-8-inch-door-preparartions-baldwin-8242\"><b>Contemporary Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8241 Patio Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1:  Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the One-Sided Modern Patio Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 1-7/8\" diameter cutouts</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
